From: MacRunner <noreply@macrunner.app>
Subject: [PATCH] winemac.drv: enable D3DMetal layer bridge on arm64

MacRunner's arm64-native DXMT path still needs the winemac.drv D3DMetal
bridge pieces: macdrv_functions for HWND->client_cocoa_view lookup,
WineMetalLayer so nextDrawable posts CLIENT_SURFACE_PRESENTED, and a
CAMetalLayer attached to the real WineContentView.

Keeping those pieces x86_64-only made the live arm64 path fall back to a
detached orphan window. Build the bridge on arm64 as well; D3DMetal itself
is not required for this path, only the Wine layer/client-surface glue.

---
 dlls/winemac.drv/cocoa_window.m    | 6 +++++-
 dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal.c        | 2 +-
 dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal_objc.h   | 2 +-
 dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal_objc.m   | 2 +-
 4 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/winemac.drv/cocoa_window.m b/dlls/winemac.drv/cocoa_window.m
--- a/dlls/winemac.drv/cocoa_window.m
+++ b/dlls/winemac.drv/cocoa_window.m
@@ -985,1 +985,5 @@
-        CAMetalLayer *layer = [WineMetalLayer layer];   /* CW HACK 22435 */
+#if defined(__x86_64__) || defined(__aarch64__)
+        CAMetalLayer *layer = [WineMetalLayer layer];   /* CW HACK 22435 - D3DMetal/DXMT live present */
+#else
+        CAMetalLayer *layer = [CAMetalLayer layer];
+#endif
diff --git a/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal.c b/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal.c
--- a/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal.c
+++ b/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal.c
@@ -25,1 +25,1 @@
-#if defined(__x86_64__)
+#if defined(__x86_64__) || defined(__aarch64__)
diff --git a/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal_objc.h b/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal_objc.h
--- a/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal_objc.h
+++ b/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal_objc.h
@@ -21,1 +21,1 @@
-#if defined(__x86_64__)
+#if defined(__x86_64__) || defined(__aarch64__)
diff --git a/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal_objc.m b/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal_objc.m
--- a/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal_objc.m
+++ b/dlls/winemac.drv/d3dmetal_objc.m
@@ -21,1 +21,1 @@
-#if defined(__x86_64__)
+#if defined(__x86_64__) || defined(__aarch64__)
